{"id":4221,"date":"2025-02-03T11:42:27","date_gmt":"2025-02-03T11:42:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolagraroadaligarh.in\/newsite\/?page_id=4221"},"modified":"2025-07-18T11:14:29","modified_gmt":"2025-07-18T05:44:29","slug":"about-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/about-us\/","title":{"rendered":"About Us"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"4221\" class=\"elementor elementor-4221\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3165b1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d3165b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;shape_divider_bottom&quot;:&quot;curve&quot;,&quot;shape_divider_bottom_negative&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shape elementor-shape-bottom\" data-negative=\"true\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n\t<path class=\"elementor-shape-fill\" d=\"M500,97C126.7,96.3,0.8,19.8,0,0v100l1000,0V1C1000,19.4,873.3,97.8,500,97z\"\/>\n<\/svg>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36a00c5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"36a00c5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c6eaba4 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"c6eaba4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n\t\t\t\tABOUT US\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5165594 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"5165594\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h1 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Cultivating lifelong <span><span>learners and achievers<\/span><\/span><\/h1><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98d4c80 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"98d4c80\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At Jaipuria Schools, our mission goes beyond academic success. We aim to shape future leaders, compassionate citizens, and innovative thinkers through a balanced approach to education. With over 70 years of legacy, we offer an environment where tradition meets modernity.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-698a177 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"698a177\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98339bf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"98339bf\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f10e9a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f10e9a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Padrauna-about-r6t25nq6yle2eqfnfbh07jku7ysogcubbfd0r68ho0.jpg\" title=\"Best CBSE school in Padrauna &#8211; Seth M.R. Jaipuria School Padrauna Campus\" alt=\"Best CBSE school in Padrauna - Seth M.R. Jaipuria School Padrauna Campus\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9aacf0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e9aacf0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4dbe4ea elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-right elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"4dbe4ea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n\t\t\t\tAbout Us\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d135b7 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"1d135b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Seth M.R. Jaipuria School, <span><span>Padrauna<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e482b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9e482b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>An academic institute should stand for dreams, building of character &amp; skills, and defining a person\u2019s life. At Jaipuria, we understand that the years that a student spends with us would \u2018shape or break\u2019 that individual, so there is great power and greater responsibility in the hands of the school. The purpose of Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna is to prepare a new generation of responsible social leaders that will help the world at large, be proactive to meet the global challenges of the 21st century and surpass beyond the realms of the ordinary. The entire value system of the school is driven around innovation, creativity and entrepreneurship. The underlying context is always that there should be the desire for excellence, zeal to go beyond the regular, and provide for growth and development of individuals and societies in the coming future. We welcome you to experience this magnificence in your city, Padrauna!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e11170d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e11170d\" data-element_type=\"container\" id=\"story\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a725030 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a725030\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2ec848 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"e2ec848\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Proven Legacy <span><span>and Heritage<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0835417 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0835417\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Long ago in 1945, Jaipuria started its journey in education with the establishment of Jaipuria College in Calcutta (now Kolkata), It is this unique heritage spanning 7 decades and 4 generations that sets apart Seth M.R. Jaipuria Schools from other educational institutes.<\/p><p>The journey continued with the establishment of its first K-12 ICSE school in Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh in 1992, which was followed by 4 management institutes in Lucknow, Noida, Jaipur, and Indore.<\/p><p>Since 2014, the journey scaled up to higher peaks. Seth M.R. Jaipuria School has witnessed exponential growth with 50+ CBSE schools across 44 cities. and is ambitious to reach 75 schools by 2025.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4f26f2 elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"a4f26f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/our-history\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-arrow-right\"><\/i>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Our History<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93b0b25 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"93b0b25\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b661b18 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b661b18\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"587\" height=\"373\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/slide1-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4239\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/slide1-1.jpg 587w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/slide1-1-300x191.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 587px) 100vw, 587px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90789b2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"90789b2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d402729 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"d402729\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_center   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Our <span><span>Journey<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f5ae01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4f5ae01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschools.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Jaipuria-Growth-Story-Page-for-Website.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82e9f01 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"82e9f01\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-841c7db elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"841c7db\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">School and <span><span>Trust Details<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d320fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6d320fc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0b4293c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0b4293c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fcf6e13 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"fcf6e13\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"193\" height=\"193\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/vikram_aggarwal.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4736\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/vikram_aggarwal.jpg 193w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/vikram_aggarwal-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 193px) 100vw, 193px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b5dc5e8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b5dc5e8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe5e508 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fe5e508\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Message From the School Director<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7878279 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7878279\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>GLOBAL EDUCATION WITH AN INDIAN SOUL<\/p><p>Welcome to Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna!<\/p><p>.Jaipuria is led by doyens of exceptional visionaries who have always remained concerned about developing next generation thought leaders. The commitment of the House of Jaipuria to provide superior quality education has only deepened and grown over the last seven decades, developing leaders who have proved their mettle in all walks of life.<\/p><p>A true leader is a liberated thinker. The process of liberation begins when you start to think for yourself. When you think you learn and you imbibe new thoughts and perspectives. This in turn helps you innovate and think out of the box. When you can think differently, you can make choices and decisions that are unconventional. These unconventional choices and decisions are what will set you apart from the crowd and establish you as a leader rather than the led.<\/p><p>Education is not merely the acquiring of a degree; it is an enduring process that should have an effect on your thoughts and actions, even after you graduate. Your education can become a leadership training exercise only when you are an active participant in the process of opening your mind to knowledge, experiences and ideas.<\/p><p>We are very glad to bring to Padrauna a champion of educational excellence. We present to you Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna, where, we put the student at the heart of the educational process. A student\u2019s tenure at Jaipuria will be marked by a number of academic and non academic opportunities, each of which will help the student develop into a successful individual, true leader and above all good human being. From in-class sessions to field trips, from experiential learning to festivals and events, every day at Jaipuria is a day our students learn and develop. A world of learning and a plethora of experiences await you within our school. Welcome to Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna! Welcome to your future.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e8bf85 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8e8bf85\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mr. Vikram Agrawal<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b140f3 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6b140f3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Director<br>\nSeth M. R. Jaipuria School, <br>\nPadrauna<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-188d1d3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"188d1d3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a23bb0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6a23bb0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dc5d73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1dc5d73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Message From the School Director<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e1e0c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5e1e0c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>RAISING STANDARDS TO ACHIEVE IT<\/p><p>Greetings from Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna!<\/p><p>Conventional teaching methods are now relics of the past. India is goingthrough humongous socio-economic and socio-political changes and is poised to become a super power in the next couple of decades. To see her through to this ultimate goal, she will need future citizens who are empowered with the requisite learning. I am pleased to state here that our goals and vision are in total synchronicity with that of our nation and it will be our unstinting endeavor to equip our students with global standards of learning so that our children become the masters of our destiny.<\/p><p>At Jaipuria School, education will go beyond books to instill social consciousness, inclusivity, ethics and an all-round personality with a healthy mind and body. That is the Jaipuria way of life and learning. It is also important for our youth to have cultural consciousness and the ability to appreciate the rich heritage of our visual and performing arts. Jaipuria School will ensure that students from their early years are exposed to and encouraged to appreciate and imbibe visual and performing arts.<\/p><p>I look forward to welcoming you and your child to the Jaipuria family, and firmly believe that you will be proud to be a part of this family.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a1fec7c elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a1fec7c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mr. Abhishek Khetan<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-340a599 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"340a599\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Director<br>\nSeth M. R. Jaipuria School, <br>\nPadrauna<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-021fb08 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"021fb08\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee83efe elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ee83efe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"193\" height=\"193\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/abhishek_khaitan.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4737\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/abhishek_khaitan.jpg 193w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/abhishek_khaitan-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 193px) 100vw, 193px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1feb974 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1feb974\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3def55a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3def55a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ae9880 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1ae9880\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"193\" height=\"193\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/siddhartha_khaitan.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4738\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/siddhartha_khaitan.jpg 193w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/siddhartha_khaitan-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 193px) 100vw, 193px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60d3f7c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"60d3f7c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-07c4eef elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"07c4eef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Message From the School Director<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf30ef5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cf30ef5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>ENCOURAGING OVERALL DEVELOPMENT<\/p><p>Greetings from Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna!<\/p><p>A School is a temple of education. It requires different methodologies, teaching aids and correct Environment for teaching-learning process, in addition to class rooms and teachers. Principles and Values that are committed to partnering parents in raising the next generation of leaders.<\/p><p>It is a commitment of management for every parents &amp; their ward who is going to take admission in Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna, is the personal Responsibility of all my Principal, Faculty, Staff &amp; Coordinator to give homely &amp; healthy atmosphere and make them learn to face any challenge of the world in a passionate manner.<\/p><p>Jaipuria School in Padrauna is being built up with the most modern &amp; modular form with keeping vastu in mind, pollution free atmosphere, to satisfy a crucial need in today\u2019s world for students to learn, observe, introspect and contemplate. Education in such an ambience is a rewarding experience.<\/p><p>I believe that Nation\u2019s Progress when they strive for the best in their Individual and Collective Growth in the Growth of one Nation, World order and mankind.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-caf5760 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"caf5760\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mr. Siddhartha Khaitan<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-218d024 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"218d024\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Director<br>\nSeth M. R. Jaipuria School, <br>\nPadrauna<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0672515 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0672515\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2c0b93 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a2c0b93\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d3b8d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1d3b8d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Message From the School Principal<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-449ec5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"449ec5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Greetings from Seth M. R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna!<\/p><p>The winds of change are blowing, and we wish to blow with the wind to grow&#8230;<\/p><p>Welcome to Seth MR Jaipuria School, Padrauna where we are dedicated to nurturing the talents, aspirations, and potential of every student. Our mission is to create a vibrant and inclusive learning environment that encourages intellectual curiosity, creative thinking, and strong moral values. We believe that education goes beyond textbooks. We focus on holistic development, fostering a sense of responsibility, compassion, and respect for others. Our dedicated faculty works diligently to provide an enriching academic experience, while also encouraging participation in co curricular activities to build well-rounded individuals.<\/p><p>We are committed to staying at the forefront of educational innovation, integrating modern technology and learning methodologies to equip our students with the skills needed to excel in a rapidly evolving world.<\/p><p>I invite you to explore our website and learn more about the opportunities and programs we offer. Together, let&#8217;s continue to strive for excellence and make Seth MR Jaipuria School ,Padrauna a happy place for our kids..<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7dc5b44 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7dc5b44\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ms. Smriti Khanna<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-453ea6f elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"453ea6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Principal<br>\nSeth M. R. Jaipuria School, <br>\nPadrauna<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c0d36c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5c0d36c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2792a67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2792a67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/Smiriti-Khanna.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4739\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/Smiriti-Khanna.jpg 400w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/Smiriti-Khanna-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/Smiriti-Khanna-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>ABOUT US Cultivating lifelong learners and achievers At Jaipuria Schools, our mission goes beyond academic success. We aim to shape future leaders, compassionate citizens, and innovative thinkers through a balanced approach to education. With over 70 years of legacy, we offer an environment where tradition meets modernity. About Us Seth M.R. Jaipuria School, Padrauna An [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4221","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4221","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4221"}],"version-history":[{"count":61,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4221\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4828,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4221\/revisions\/4828"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4221"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}